  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/5d63e067fd5bd21f5beb4a8eb644c4104ea3afb2fef8d55dbad3940e538e204d.png] \n\nOption 1) : 63 ÷ 15 + 21 × 5 - 4 = 74\n\nAfter interchanging the number 15 and 21 in given equation the equation is as follows : 63 ÷ 21 + 15 × 5 - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ __**63 ÷ 21**__ + 15 × 5 - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ 3 + __**15**____** × 5**__ - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ __**3**____** + 75**__ - 4 = 74\n\n⇒ __**78**____** - 4**__ = 74\n\n⇒ **74**** = 74**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) : 62 ÷ 31 - 21 + 15 × 3 = 80\n\nAfter interchanging the number 15 and 21 in given equation the equation is as follows : 62 ÷ 31 - 15 + 21 × 3 = 80\n\n⇒ __**62 ÷ 31**__ - 15 + 21 × 3 = 80\n\n⇒ 2 - 15 + __**21**____** × 3**__ = 80\n\n⇒ __**2**__ - 15 __**+ 63**__ = 80\n\n⇒ __**65 - 15**__ = 80\n\n⇒ 50 ≠ 80\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) : 24 - 21 ÷ 3 + 15 - 7 = 23\n\nAfter interchanging the number 15 and 21 in given equation the equation is as follows : 24 - 15 ÷ 3 + 21 - 7 = 23\n\n⇒ 24 - __**15**____** ÷ 3**__ + 21 - 7 = 23\n\n⇒ __**24**__ - 5 __**+ 21**__ - 7 = 23\n\n⇒ 45 __**- 5**____** - 7**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**45 - 12**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 33 ≠ 23\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) : 26 + 21 × 15 ÷ 3 - 14 = 108\n\nAfter interchanging the number 15 and 21 in given equation the equation is as follows : 26 + 15 × 21 ÷ 3 - 14 = 108\n\n⇒ 26 + 15 × __**21 **____**÷ 3**__ - 14 = 108\n\n⇒ 26 + __**15 × 7**__ - 14 = 108\n\n⇒ __**26 + 105**__ - 14 = 108\n\n⇒ __**131**____** - 14**__ = 108\n\n⇒ 117 ≠ 108\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"63 ÷ 15 + 21 × 5 - 4 = 74\".**",
